# JEWEL 2.6.0 Au+Au 200 GeV 0-10%: dijets (PPJJ)
# pT-hat > 15 GeV, pT-hat weighted; run with set_medium("simple")
# recoils kept; thermal momenta written as status 3 for 4MomSub
PROCESS PPJJ
SQRTS 200.
PTMIN 5.
PTMAX -1.
ETAMAX 2.5
PDFSET 13100
MASS 197
NPROTON 79
ISOCHANNEL XX
WEIGHTED F
KEEPRECOILS T
SPLITINTFILE tables/splitint.dat
PDFFILE tables/pdfs_ct14nlo.dat
XSECFILE tables/xsecs_ct14nlo.dat
MEDIUMPARAMS medium_auau200_0010.dat
NF 3
HADRO T
MPI F
SHORTHEPMC T
WRITESCATCEN T
WRITEDUMMIES F
